{"page":555,"width":1672,"height":2537,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"618","words":[{"text":"618","x":170,"y":141,"width":56,"height":28}]},{"text":"Chapter 14 파일 시스템 구현","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":296,"y":142,"width":113,"height":28},{"text":"14","x":422,"y":144,"width":35,"height":21},{"text":"파일","x":486,"y":144,"width":40,"height":23},{"text":"시스템","x":536,"y":144,"width":61,"height":24},{"text":"구현","x":606,"y":144,"width":40,"height":25}]},{"text":"14.1 파일 시스템 구조 Fi1e-system structure","words":[{"text":"14.1","x":169,"y":271,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":318,"y":266,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"시스템","x":401,"y":266,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"구조","x":515,"y":268,"width":70,"height":34},{"text":"Fi1e-system","x":612,"y":278,"width":191,"height":30},{"text":"structure","x":814,"y":278,"width":159,"height":26}]},{"text":"파일 시스템을 유지하기 위한 보조저장징치로 디스크가 대부분 시용된다. 디스크가 보조","words":[{"text":"파일","x":296,"y":357,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"시스템을","x":369,"y":357,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"유지하기","x":498,"y":357,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"위한","x":628,"y":358,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"보조저장징치로","x":696,"y":358,"width":209,"height":36},{"text":"디스크가","x":918,"y":360,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"대부분","x":1054,"y":360,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"시용된다.","x":1161,"y":360,"width":139,"height":35},{"text":"디스크가","x":1317,"y":357,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"보조","x":1459,"y":360,"width":61,"height":27}]},{"text":"저장장치로 A卜\u0026되는 데에는 다음과 같은 2가지 특성이 있기 때문이다.","words":[{"text":"저장장치로","x":297,"y":414,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"A卜\u0026되는","x":458,"y":415,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"데에는","x":587,"y":416,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"다음과","x":685,"y":416,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":786,"y":416,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"2가지","x":854,"y":416,"width":75,"height":35},{"text":"특성이","x":944,"y":417,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"있기","x":1051,"y":416,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"때문이다.","x":1126,"y":416,"width":137,"height":35}]},{"text":"1. 디스크는 추가 장소를 시용히지 않고 재기록이 기능하다. 디스크로부터 한 블록-을","words":[{"text":"1.","x":323,"y":505,"width":23,"height":25},{"text":"디스크는","x":371,"y":501,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"추가","x":501,"y":502,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"장소를","x":573,"y":502,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"시용히지","x":673,"y":501,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"않고","x":805,"y":501,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"재기록이","x":877,"y":502,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"기능하다.","x":1014,"y":502,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"디스크로부터","x":1166,"y":501,"width":194,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":1378,"y":500,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"블록-을","x":1424,"y":500,"width":95,"height":34}]},{"text":"읽고, 변경하여 같은 블록에 재기록이 기능하다.","words":[{"text":"읽고,","x":370,"y":558,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"변경하여","x":449,"y":558,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":577,"y":559,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"블록에","x":646,"y":558,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"재기록이","x":747,"y":558,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"기능하다.","x":876,"y":558,"width":128,"height":35}]},{"text":"2. 디스크에 있는 임의의 블록의 정보를 직접 접근할 수 있다. 따라서 임의의 파일을","words":[{"text":"2.","x":320,"y":619,"width":24,"height":26},{"text":"디스크에","x":368,"y":615,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":502,"y":616,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"임의의","x":574,"y":616,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"블록의","x":672,"y":616,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"정보를","x":776,"y":616,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"직접","x":879,"y":616,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"접근할","x":953,"y":616,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1058,"y":616,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":1107,"y":615,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"따라서","x":1194,"y":615,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"임의의","x":1311,"y":614,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"파일을","x":1423,"y":614,"width":94,"height":34}]},{"text":"순차적 또는 무작위 방법으로 쉽게 접근할 수 있다. 그리고 한 파일로부터 다른 파","words":[{"text":"순차적","x":366,"y":672,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"또는","x":469,"y":675,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"무작위","x":539,"y":673,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"방법으로","x":640,"y":673,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"쉽게","x":770,"y":673,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"접근할","x":842,"y":673,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":944,"y":673,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":989,"y":672,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"그리고","x":1071,"y":672,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":1182,"y":673,"width":34,"height":32},{"text":"파일로부터","x":1229,"y":672,"width":163,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":1411,"y":671,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"파","x":1486,"y":673,"width":31,"height":34}]},{"text":"일로 전환이 요구될 때, 드라이브가 읽기-쓰기 헤드를 이동시기고 매체가 회전하","words":[{"text":"일로","x":368,"y":731,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"전환이","x":440,"y":730,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"요구될","x":540,"y":730,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"때,","x":642,"y":731,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"드라이브가","x":691,"y":730,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"읽기-쓰기","x":856,"y":731,"width":143,"height":35},{"text":"헤드를","x":1017,"y":731,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"이동시기고","x":1128,"y":730,"width":165,"height":35},{"text":"매체가","x":1308,"y":729,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"회전하","x":1423,"y":729,"width":94,"height":35}]},{"text":"는 동안 기다리면 된다","words":[{"text":"는","x":365,"y":790,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"동안","x":405,"y":788,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"기다리면","x":478,"y":788,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"된다","x":605,"y":788,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"비휘발성 메모리(NVM) 장치는 파일 저장 및 파일 시스템의 장소로 점점 더 많이","words":[{"text":"비휘발성","x":347,"y":905,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"메모리(NVM)","x":478,"y":905,"width":193,"height":38},{"text":"장치는","x":687,"y":904,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":790,"y":905,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"저장","x":866,"y":906,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"및","x":941,"y":905,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":984,"y":905,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"시스템의","x":1063,"y":905,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"장소로","x":1209,"y":905,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"점점","x":1326,"y":905,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"더","x":1409,"y":904,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"많이","x":1454,"y":904,"width":58,"height":36}]},{"text":"시용되고 있다. 하드 디스크외는 달리 재기록이 불가능하며 성능 특성이 다르다. 디스크","words":[{"text":"시용되고","x":289,"y":964,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":422,"y":964,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"하드","x":499,"y":964,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"디스크외는","x":570,"y":963,"width":147,"height":35},{"text":"달리","x":729,"y":963,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"재기록이","x":801,"y":964,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"불가능하며","x":934,"y":964,"width":154,"height":35},{"text":"성능","x":1106,"y":964,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"특성이","x":1184,"y":964,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"다르다.","x":1299,"y":964,"width":106,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":1422,"y":962,"width":94,"height":35}]},{"text":"및 NVM 장치 구조에 대해서는 11장에서 자세히 설명한다.","words":[{"text":"및","x":290,"y":1024,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"NVM","x":328,"y":1026,"width":85,"height":28},{"text":"장치","x":425,"y":1022,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"구조에","x":493,"y":1022,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"대해서는","x":594,"y":1022,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"11장에서","x":722,"y":1022,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"자세히","x":856,"y":1023,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"설명한다.","x":960,"y":1022,"width":132,"height":35}]},{"text":"I/O 효율성을 향상하기 위해 메모리와 대용량 스토리지 간의 I/O 전송이 블록 단","words":[{"text":"I/O","x":343,"y":1084,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"효율성을","x":416,"y":1081,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"향상하기","x":545,"y":1080,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":677,"y":1081,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"메모리와","x":749,"y":1081,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"대용량","x":883,"y":1081,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"스토리지","x":988,"y":1081,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"간의","x":1131,"y":1082,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"I/O","x":1211,"y":1085,"width":67,"height":32},{"text":"전송이","x":1295,"y":1082,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"블록","x":1407,"y":1081,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"단","x":1486,"y":1082,"width":31,"height":33}]},{"text":"위로 수행된다. 하드 디스크 드라이브의 각 블록에는 하나 이상의 섹터가 있다. 디스크","words":[{"text":"위로","x":289,"y":1142,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"수행된다.","x":360,"y":1139,"width":125,"height":37},{"text":"하드","x":500,"y":1139,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"디스크","x":574,"y":1140,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"드라이브의","x":674,"y":1140,"width":147,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":838,"y":1140,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"블록에는","x":881,"y":1140,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"하나","x":1021,"y":1139,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"이상의","x":1101,"y":1140,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"섹터가","x":1214,"y":1141,"width":103,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1333,"y":1141,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":1424,"y":1139,"width":92,"height":35}]},{"text":"드라이브에 따라 섹터 크기는 일반적으로 512바이트 또는 4,096바이트이다. NVM 장","words":[{"text":"드라이브에","x":288,"y":1199,"width":146,"height":36},{"text":"따라","x":450,"y":1199,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"섹터","x":522,"y":1200,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"크기는","x":593,"y":1200,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"일반적으로","x":697,"y":1199,"width":148,"height":36},{"text":"512바이트","x":858,"y":1199,"width":148,"height":36},{"text":"또는","x":1020,"y":1201,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"4,096바이트이다.","x":1098,"y":1200,"width":263,"height":36},{"text":"NVM","x":1378,"y":1202,"width":93,"height":29},{"text":"장","x":1486,"y":1199,"width":32,"height":35}]},{"text":"치에는 일반적으로 4,096바이트의 블록이 있으며 디스크 드라이브에서 시용하는 것과","words":[{"text":"치에는","x":288,"y":1259,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"일반적으로","x":395,"y":1259,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"4,096바이트의","x":552,"y":1259,"width":193,"height":36},{"text":"블록이","x":762,"y":1259,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"있으며","x":871,"y":1259,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":979,"y":1259,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"드라이브에서","x":1088,"y":1259,"width":197,"height":36},{"text":"시용하는","x":1306,"y":1258,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"것과","x":1457,"y":1257,"width":62,"height":36}]},{"text":"유사한 전송 방법이 사용된다.","words":[{"text":"유사한","x":286,"y":1318,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"전송","x":389,"y":1318,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"방법이","x":458,"y":1318,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"사용된다.","x":555,"y":1318,"width":124,"height":36}]},{"text":"파일 시스템은 쉽게 데이터를 저장하고, 찾고 또한 인출할 수 있게 함으로써 저장장","words":[{"text":"파일","x":343,"y":1377,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"시스템은","x":416,"y":1377,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"쉽게","x":544,"y":1377,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"데이터를","x":614,"y":1377,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"저장하고,","x":745,"y":1377,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"찾고","x":887,"y":1377,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"또한","x":961,"y":1378,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"인출할","x":1040,"y":1378,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1147,"y":1378,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"있게","x":1196,"y":1377,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"함으로써","x":1275,"y":1376,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"저장장","x":1424,"y":1375,"width":94,"height":36}]},{"text":"치를 더욱 효율적이고 편리하게 시용할 수 있게 한다. 파일 시스템은 크게 두 가지의 설","words":[{"text":"치를","x":287,"y":1436,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"더욱","x":360,"y":1436,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"효율적이고","x":431,"y":1437,"width":145,"height":35},{"text":"편리하게","x":590,"y":1437,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"시용할","x":718,"y":1436,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":821,"y":1437,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있게","x":866,"y":1436,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":938,"y":1436,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":1023,"y":1436,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"시스템은","x":1101,"y":1437,"width":134,"height":35},{"text":"크게","x":1248,"y":1437,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"두","x":1328,"y":1439,"width":35,"height":33},{"text":"가지의","x":1377,"y":1435,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"설","x":1488,"y":1435,"width":27,"height":34}]},{"text":"계 문제를 제기한다. 첫 번째 문제는 파일 시스템이 사용자에게 어떻게 보여야 할지를","words"